  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KORCHA PLAIN IRRIGATION PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EFFECTING AT A COST OF US$ 6.50 MILLION THE REHABILITATION AND MODERNIZATION OF A GRAVITATIONAL IRRIGATION SYSTEM OVER AN AREA OF 7,000 HECTARES IN THE KORCHA PLAIN IN SOUTH EASTERN ALBANIA. THIS WOULD LEAD TO CROPPING INTENSITY AND HIGHER YIELD PER HECTARE OF MAJOR CROPS LIKE WHEAT, SUGAR BEET,POTATO AND FODDER ETC. OVERALL THE PROJECT WOULD ENHANC E FARM INCOME AND ECONOMIC CONDITIONS IN THE AREA.</narrative>
  </description>
